sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio
    participant Auth as UserController / AuthController
    participant Users as UserService
    participant JWT as JwtUtils
    participant Redis as Redis Token Cache
    participant Security as JWT Filter / Spring Security

    User->>Folio: sign in
    Folio->>Auth: POST /users/login
    Auth->>Users: authenticate username + BCrypt password
    Users-->>Auth: authenticated username
    Auth->>JWT: generate access + refresh JWT
    JWT->>Redis: cache token IDs with TTL
    Auth-->>Folio: access token + refresh token
    Folio->>Security: protected API + Bearer access token
    Security->>Redis: validate token ID and blacklist state
    Security-->>Folio: API response
    alt access token nears expiry
        Security->>JWT: proactive access-token refresh
        JWT->>Redis: cache new access token ID
        Security-->>Folio: New-Token response header
    else refresh-token fallback
        Folio->>Auth: POST /auth/refreshToken
        Auth->>Redis: validate refreshTokenId
        Auth->>JWT: verify signature and issue new token pair
        JWT->>Redis: cache new token IDs
        Auth-->>Folio: new access + refresh tokens
    end
    alt logout current device
        Folio->>Auth: POST /users/logout
        Auth->>Redis: blacklist access token until expiry<br/>remove active token entry
    else logout all devices
        Folio->>Auth: POST /users/logout-all
        Auth->>Redis: remove all cached access-token IDs for user
    end
    Folio->>Folio: clear local auth, chat, and route state
